        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "The greatest music battle festival in history, Music Battle Awards 2025! Kongming and Eiko take on the challenge!  Furthermore, the descendant of Sima Yi, Sima Jun, stands before them as a young strategist!!",
